    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "# Plan Your App Idea & Scope\r\n\r\n**Goal:** Use this space to sketch the high-level idea and scope of your app.\r\n\r\nIn this milestone, this sketch is about **intent and scope**, not full system logic. Use it to think through:\r\n- who your app is for\r\n- what pages or states exist\r\n- what actions users can take\r\n\r\nYou do **not** need to map detailed logic, decisions, or data flow yet. That will come in the next milestone.\r\n\r\nSimple boxes and labels are enough. Focus on clarity, not completeness.\r\n",
    "bubble_choice_description": "Use this space to sketch the high-level idea and scope of your app. You can outline what pages or states might exist and what users can do, without worrying about detailed logic or data flow yet.",
